#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: divi5-image-mask.php
msgid "Image Mask for Divi 5"
msgstr "Bildmaske für Divi 5"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: divi5-image-mask.php
msgid "https://github.com/markusritschel/divi5-image-mask"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: divi5-image-mask.php
msgid ""
"An image mask for the Image module of the Divi 5 Visual Builder: cut the "
"image into one of Divi's mask shapes or into a custom SVG mask."
msgstr ""
"Eine Bildmaske für das Bild-Modul des Divi 5 Visual Builders: das Bild in "
"eine von Divis Maskenformen oder eine eigene SVG-Maske schneiden."

#. Author of the plugin
#: divi5-image-mask.php
msgid "Markus Ritschel"
msgstr ""

#: divi5-image-mask.php:72
msgid "Image Mask"
msgstr "Bildmaske"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:73
msgid "Mask Shape"
msgstr "Maskenform"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:74
msgid ""
"One of Divi's mask shapes. The image stays visible where a Divi background "
"would show through the same mask."
msgstr ""
"Eine von Divis Maskenformen. Das Bild bleibt sichtbar, wo ein Divi-"
"Hintergrund durch dieselbe Maske scheint."

#: divi5-image-mask.php:75
msgid "Custom Mask"
msgstr "Eigene Maske"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:76
msgid ""
"An SVG or PNG instead of the mask shape. The image stays visible where the "
"mask is opaque."
msgstr ""
"Ein SVG oder PNG statt der Maskenform. Das Bild bleibt sichtbar, wo die "
"Maske deckend ist."

